; A `pad` serves the balances of later days only: a balance on the day of the pad
; comes before it, whatever its `time`, as beancount knows no times. Zhang orders by
; `time`, and puts a pad after every balance of its day.
option "operating_currency" "CNY"

1970-01-01 commodity CNY
1970-01-01 open Assets:A
1970-01-01 open Equity:Open

2024-03-01 balance Assets:A  0 CNY
  time: "10:00:00"
2024-03-01 pad Assets:A Equity:Open
2024-03-02 balance Assets:A  150 CNY
  time: "09:00:00"
